24:["$","p","7",{"className":"mt-4 text-pretty text-[15.5px] leading-7 text-ink-soft sm:text-base sm:leading-8","children":"Getting root canal therapy in Wyoming, OH, begins with making a small hole in the tooth so we can access the inner part. Once we’re inside, we eliminate the infection from the pulp and completely disinfect the area."}]
25:["$","p","8",{"className":"mt-4 text-pretty text-[15.5px] leading-7 text-ink-soft sm:text-base sm:leading-8","children":"When everything’s cleared out and cleaned, we fill the spaces with dental material and close up the tooth, placing a crown on it for protection."}]
