27:["$","p","10",{"className":"mt-4 text-pretty text-[15.5px] leading-7 text-ink-soft sm:text-base sm:leading-8","children":"They do have a reputation for this. But root canals have come a long way, providing a treatment approach that’s no more uncomfortable than getting a filling. We numb the area so you won’t feel anything, though you might have mild soreness afterward."}]
28:["$","h2","11",{"className":"scroll-mt-32 text-balance font-display tracking-[-0.03em] text-ink mt-12 text-3xl first:mt-0 sm:text-4xl","children":"What Are the Benefits of Getting a Root Canal?"}]
29:["$","p","12",{"className":"mt-4 text-pretty text-[15.5px] leading-7 text-ink-soft sm:text-base sm:leading-8","children":"Treating infections before they get worse is always the best solution. Root canals do this when infections reach deep inside your tooth, preventing more severe complications and allowing you to keep your natural tooth."}]
